menu "OTA updates"

config OTA
    bool "MCUmgr/SMP server and A/B firmware slots (RP2350 boot ROM)"
    default n
    help
      Firmware updates over UDP port 1337 with the MCUmgr protocol (smpmgr,
      mcumgr-client, nRF Connect Device Manager). Images land in the other
      of two boot-ROM A/B partitions, are checked against the ECDSA public
      key in src/ota/ota_pubkey.h, and boot try-before-you-buy: the ROM
      reverts to the old slot unless the new firmware buys itself after a
      healthy start. Also exposes the os, stat and fs groups. Requires the
      partition table in partitions.json to be provisioned once (tools/
      provision.sh).

endmenu
